{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:eef983d446d62fd8","name":"Siang Lance","source":{"id":"source:reference-eef983d446d62fd8","title":"Siang Lance","revision":20770,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:28:56Z","sha256":"203b1cf1c96b8d46a239605b0aec185f056d75ba57a2582eb375abd905bd3795","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20770","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Siang%20Lance&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-eef983d446d62fd8","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Siang Lance is one of the few types of technological devices found on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kilia IV"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kilia_IV?action=edit&redlink=1"},", although only a small number of functional Siang Lances remain. By law, only members of a noble house may use a Siang Lance. In practice, a Siang Lance is given to active members of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Kilian Rangers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Kilian_Rangers","referenceId":"reference:213d5b285472d1c3"}," as a badge of office and to remind themselves and others of one half of their oaths: to defend justice, chivalry, and the people of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kilia IV"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kilia_IV?action=edit&redlink=1"},". A Siang Lance is an ancient model of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sporting Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sporting_Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:71fc5e161a6b812a"}," with an affixed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bayonet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bayonet","referenceId":"reference:a8f16c5b56fb4ef7"},". It is typically wielded with one hand, leaving the other hand free to use the Kilian Ranger's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Gauntlet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Gauntlet","referenceId":"reference:656b8587db9184bf"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Siang Lance can be used to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},". When you would make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," against a target, you may choose either to fire the Siang Lance as a ranged weapon or to use the weapon's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bayonet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bayonet","referenceId":"reference:a8f16c5b56fb4ef7"}," as a melee weapon. A Siang Lance requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 100 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:c954289d43de9110"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 4 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Accurate:"]}," This weapon takes no penalty when firing at targets at Short ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
